WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:09.816
Decompose the wait before you change anything: calls times TTFT, plus output over speed, plus time outside the model.

3
00:00:10.096 --> 00:00:14.107
Attack output first, with shapes, less commentary, and measured effort.

4
00:00:14.387 --> 00:00:17.629
Stream for people who watch, and log the right timestamps.

5
00:00:17.909 --> 00:00:27.467
Cut and overlap calls, precompute what can wait, and reserve fast mode for when the no-cost levers are exhausted, reporting its price beside its gain.

6
00:00:27.747 --> 00:00:35.256
Measure p50, p95, and p99 with enough samples, against an SLO, comparing within one run.

7
00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:38.885
Next week you’ll put these measurements on a dashboard with tracing.
